{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o031b","title":"濮阳相持后因蝗饥退军","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o031b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操劳军再攻，与吕布相持百余日；蝗灾与饥荒发生，吕布粮尽，双方撤军。","evidence":["wudi-e-o031b-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-8fea96f4e429d953c2b0","label":"正文","text":"太祖与吕布濮阳数不利各引去","evidence":["chengguo-q-5594dcc5dd09bb8826af"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-d4ca43741d3da192ba33","label":"正文","text":"太祖引军还与布战于濮阳不利相持百余日后各引去","evidence":["lvzang-q-1a7e7132e3679b358b4d"]},{"id":"liusima-a-b9949a6e336110914235","label":"正文","text":"关东兵散，曹操与吕布相持于濮阳","evidence":["liusima-q-70f269e8d2742fe3e902"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"劳军再战退军","evidence":["wudi-e-o031b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"相持退军","evidence":["wudi-e-o031b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"濮阳","evidence":["wudi-e-o031b-q"]},"time":{"label":"兴平元年","year":194,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o031b-q","wudi-q-o028","wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe"],"chronology":"wudi-y194","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o028","basis":"兴平元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,219,"O031b"],"order":101}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-5594dcc5dd09bb8826af","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-07b777464b276c723d51","layer":"original","quote":"太祖与吕布战于濮阳，数不利。蝗虫起，乃各引去","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-70f269e8d2742fe3e902","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3cc1111157b9df035934","layer":"original","quote":"久之，关东兵散，太祖与吕布相持于濮阳","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1a7e7132e3679b358b4d","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-2d73f29c539e1668f151","layer":"original","quote":"太祖引军还，与布战于濮阳。太祖军不利，相持百余日。是时岁旱、虫蝗，少谷，百姓相食，布东屯山阳","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o031b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-876ab9be287bc4211eec","layer":"original","quote":"未至营止〖8〗，诸将未与太祖相见，皆怖。太祖乃自力劳军〖9〗，令军中促为攻具〖10〗。进，复攻之，与布相守百余日。蝗虫起，百姓大饿。布粮食亦尽，各引去。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":135,"end":211,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
